{"id":"d98c56ef00c67ca3","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-cfg-regular-intersection.md","title":"Intersection of a CFL with a Regular Language","display":"thm-context-free-intersection-regular — Intersection of a CFL with a Regular Language","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-cfg-regular-intersection","aliases":["73-thm-cfg-regular-intersection","73-thm-context-free-intersection-regular"],"display":"thm-context-free-intersection-regular — Intersection of a CFL with a Regular Language","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-cfg-regular-intersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-cfg-regular-intersection</span><span>73-thm-context-free-intersection-regular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-context-free-intersection-regular — Intersection of a CFL with a Regular Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83639a9615c06195\" href=\"?note=83639a9615c06195\" title=\"73-df-cfg-language-class\">73-df-cfg-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c284ffb568a496fd\" href=\"?note=c284ffb568a496fd\" title=\"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class\">73-df-finite-automaton-language-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33e207bac16abe1a\" href=\"?note=33e207bac16abe1a\" title=\"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence\">73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；字母与有限词的类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (context-free and regular language classes)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n(A\\cap R\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n(A\\cap R\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Run a PDA for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and a DFA for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> in product control. Each consumed symbol updates both state components; epsilon PDA moves leave the DFA component fixed.</li>\n<li>The product accepts exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\cap R\">\\(A\\cap R\\)</span> and remains a PDA, proving the stated closure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-automaton-language-class","status":"resolved","id":"c284ffb568a496fd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e207bac16abe1a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-pushdown-grammar-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；字母与有限词的类型见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}regular}\\vdash\n\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}\\,\\forall R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\;\n(A\\cap R\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma})","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"A\\cap R","display":false}],"bytes":1311,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc053bd7e7b16f86","a